WEBVTT

00:22:00.579 --> 00:22:04.746
Well, this is an interesting twist on, I
guess, how I've thought about intuition,

00:22:05.038 --> 00:22:08.663
especially in a hiring context, but I
think it applies to a lot of places.

00:22:09.621 --> 00:22:14.496
My advice for a long time has been, don't
trust your intuition, test your intuition,

00:22:15.246 --> 00:22:18.579
because I think about intuition is a
subconscious pattern recognition.

00:22:18.996 --> 00:22:21.663
And I want to make those patterns
conscious so I can figure out

00:22:21.663 --> 00:22:25.871
whether whatever relationship I have
detected in the past is relevant to

00:22:25.871 --> 00:22:29.579
the present. And it seems like that's
what what you've argued

00:22:29.579 --> 00:22:31.288
as well when you've said, look, you know,